      "text": "⚠🚘 TRAFFIC ADVISORY\n\nPlease be advised that initial sewer line work will be completed on Greenwood Drive between Thursday, May 28 to Monday, June 1,  weather permitting.\n\nThe project will connect the sewer lines from the Greenwood Drive residential development to the main line. A portion of Greenwood Drive will be reduced to one lane during construction, with traffic personnel on-site.\n\nMotorists are asked to respect and obey traffic personnel, as well as to consider alternate routes to avoid possible delays.\n\n#Summerside",
